  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that, shortest&nbsp;distance between two line is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>So, S.D.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>Calculating&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Now again,&nbsp;</p><p>S.D.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>squaring&nbsp;both side we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>225</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>120</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>60</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>140</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>350</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>80</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>275</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p><p>So sum of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p>",
